@host = http://localhost:5138
@email = demo@example.com
@password = Demo_Pass1!

### Register a customer (creates a Customer profile + user)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "name": "Demo Customer" }

### Login -> copy accessToken into @token below
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Create an order (safe to retry with the same Idempotency-Key)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Get order
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List my orders (paged)
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel order (releases reserved stock)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready
